        "line": 304,
        "text": "0 < c → ContDiff ℝ ∞ b → ∃ F, ContDiff ℝ ∞ F ∧ F 0 = b 0 / (2 * c) ∧ ∀ x > 0, (∫ u in (0:ℝ)..x, (Real.exp (-c / u ^ 2) / u ^ j) * b u) = Real.exp (-c / x ^ 2) * x ^ (3 - (j : ℝ)) * F x — the paper's integral in the paper's own notation, with 3 - j a real power"
